{
  "uid": "gravitee-otel-slo",
  "title": "Gravitee OTel \u00b7 SLOs & Error Budgets",
  "description": "Availability and latency objectives per API, with multi-window burn-rate alerting, from the Gateway's span metrics.",
  "tags": [
    "gravitee-otel"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Gravitee dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "gravitee-otel"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds_prom",
        "label": "Metrics (Prometheus)",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "regex": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "name": "api",
        "label": "API",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${ds_prom}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(gravitee_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}, gravitee_api_name)",
          "refId": "api"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(gravitee_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}, gravitee_api_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Service level objectives (all APIs)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How SLOs are computed",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n**Objectives:** 99.5 % of calls succeed (non-5xx) over 30 days \u2192 **error budget = 0.5 %**; calls answered within **500 ms**.\n\n* **SLIs and burn rates, per API and overall,** are Prometheus *recording rules* on the span metrics\n  (`prometheus/rules/gravitee-otel-slo.rules.yml`): cheap to evaluate, alertable.\n* **Alerts** use the multi-window, multi-burn-rate pattern, **per API**:\n  *page* at 14.4\u00d7 (5m & 1h), *ticket* at 6\u00d7 (30m & 6h).\n\nChange the objectives in `otel/build.py` and rebuild.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability SLI (30d)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prom}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:sli_availability:ratio_rate30d",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "hide": false,
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error budget remaining",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prom}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:error_budget_remaining:ratio30d",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "hide": false,
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latency SLI: calls \u2264 500 ms (30d)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prom}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:sli_latency:ratio_rate30d",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "hide": false,
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.95
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Firing alerts",
      "description": "Alerts firing from prometheus/rules/gravitee-otel-alerts.rules.yml.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prom}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname=~\"Gravitee.*\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "hide": false,
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error budget burn rate",
      "description": "1 = consuming the budget exactly at the allowed pace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prom}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:error_burn_rate:5m",
          "legendFormat": "5m",
          "hide": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:error_burn_rate:1h",
          "legendFormat": "1h",
          "hide": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:error_burn_rate:6h",
          "legendFormat": "6h",
          "hide": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "5m"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Mean",
          "sortDesc": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Availability SLI (rolling windows)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prom}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:sli_availability:ratio_rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "5m",
          "hide": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee_otel:sli_availability:ratio_rate1h",
          "legendFormat": "1h",
          "hide": false,
